1
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:14,920
Are you sure this is the place?

2
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:17,640
That's what the map says.

3
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:21,360
I don't trust that map.
It got us lost twice already.

4
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:23,400
Three times.

5
00:00:24,840 --> 00:00:27,720
Fine. Three times.
But who's counting?

6
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:33,560
Wait. Did you hear that?

7
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:36,280
Hear what? I didn't hear anything.

8
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:40,120
Exactly. The birds stopped singing.

9
00:00:44,520 --> 00:00:46,800
We should go back to the car.

10
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:50,240
Now you're talking sense, Mr. Whitaker.

11
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:54,080
It's a piece of cake. Trust me.

12
00:00:55,360 --> 00:00:58,000
Last time you said that,
we ended up in Portugal.
